WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.067
-We have exactly
three shows left

00:00:02.067 --> 00:00:03.167
before we go on Christmas break,

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:04.701
which means it's time
for that beloved

00:00:04.701 --> 00:00:05.934
"Tonight Show" tradition.

00:00:05.934 --> 00:00:08.267
It's time for "12 Days
of Christmas Sweaters".

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:09.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.734 --> 00:00:11.868
-♪ 12 Days
of Christmas Sweaters ♪

00:00:11.868 --> 00:00:14.400
♪ Three days left ♪

00:00:16.567 --> 00:00:17.634
-That's right.

00:00:17.634 --> 00:00:20.133
Every show between now
and Christmas

00:00:20.133 --> 00:00:23.701
we'll be giving one lucky
audience member a bodacious

00:00:23.701 --> 00:00:26.601
Christmas sweater from the
Countdown to Christmas cabinet.

00:00:26.601 --> 00:00:30.400
[ Cheers and applause ]
That's right.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:34.400
And since there are
three shows left, let's open

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.701
door number three.

00:00:36.701 --> 00:00:40.300
[ Drumroll ]

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.734
Ooh!
-Ooh.

00:00:42.734 --> 00:00:43.767
-Wow.

00:00:43.767 --> 00:00:46.400
♪♪

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:47.868
Wow.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:47.868 --> 00:00:49.734
Thank you very much.

00:00:49.734 --> 00:00:54.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:54.667 --> 00:00:56.000
[ Chuckles ]

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.067
Wow.

00:00:57.067 --> 00:00:58.567
Can we dim the lights
a little bit?

00:00:58.567 --> 00:01:05.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:05.534 --> 00:01:06.634
Hm.

00:01:06.634 --> 00:01:07.634
Beautiful.

00:01:07.634 --> 00:01:09.267
All right, now let's see
who's going home

00:01:09.267 --> 00:01:10.300
with tonight's sweater.

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:11.667
Everyone, look
at your seat number.

00:01:11.667 --> 00:01:13.634
If I call your number,
come on down.

00:01:13.634 --> 00:01:15.400
Quest, can I get a drumroll,
please?

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:19.467
[ Drumroll ]

00:01:19.467 --> 00:01:21.701
302.

00:01:21.701 --> 00:01:25.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:25.567 --> 00:01:27.067
Come on down!

00:01:27.067 --> 00:01:29.167
♪♪

00:01:29.167 --> 00:01:30.601
There you go.

00:01:30.601 --> 00:01:36.968
♪♪

00:01:36.968 --> 00:01:43.334
♪♪

00:01:43.334 --> 00:01:47.200
Hello!

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:48.567
Hello. How're you doing?

00:01:48.567 --> 00:01:50.167
-Good. Nice to meet you.
-Nice to see you.

00:01:50.167 --> 00:01:51.501
What is your name?
-Jackie.

00:01:51.501 --> 00:01:52.534
-Jackie, where are you from?

00:01:52.534 --> 00:01:54.000
-Long Island.
-Long Island!

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.434
I love Long Island.

00:01:55.434 --> 00:01:57.400
[ Cheers and applause ]
I love Long Island.

00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:59.400
I know it gets a little chilly
out in Long Island.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:00.901
You have a beautiful sweater.
-Thank you.

00:02:00.901 --> 00:02:04.467
-But it's missing -- it has a
couple of beautiful holes in it.

00:02:04.467 --> 00:02:05.601
[ Laughter ]
I think this --

00:02:05.601 --> 00:02:06.634
you'll need this in Long Island.

00:02:06.634 --> 00:02:07.767
And you'll just fit right in.

00:02:07.767 --> 00:02:09.000
No one will even know
you're wearing it.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:10.067
-No one will know.
-Would you like to try it on

00:02:10.067 --> 00:02:11.067
right now for everyone?
-Absolutely.

00:02:11.067 --> 00:02:12.067
-Oh, this is gonna be fun.

00:02:12.067 --> 00:02:15.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:15.267 --> 00:02:16.300
Here you go.

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:17.434
There's no right way
to put it on,

00:02:17.434 --> 00:02:19.267
I gotta be honest.

00:02:19.267 --> 00:02:21.934
Well, you got your arms in
the sleeve, that's a win.

00:02:21.934 --> 00:02:23.300
-Thanks.

00:02:24.534 --> 00:02:25.534
-Oh!

00:02:25.534 --> 00:02:28.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.601
-[ Laughs ]
-Oh, my gosh.

00:02:29.601 --> 00:02:30.834
Look at you.

00:02:30.834 --> 00:02:31.934
Look at this.

00:02:31.934 --> 00:02:33.100
You look gorgeous.

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:34.100
Look.

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:35.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:35.267 --> 00:02:38.067
[ Laughs ] You look beautiful.

00:02:38.067 --> 00:02:39.300
Oh, my gosh.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:40.868
Is that not fantastic?

00:02:40.868 --> 00:02:41.868
Happy holidays.

00:02:41.868 --> 00:02:43.067
It's nice to see you.

00:02:43.067 --> 00:02:44.267
Thank you for coming
to the show.

00:02:44.267 --> 00:02:45.968
You look great.
Thank you, thank you, thank you.

00:02:45.968 --> 00:02:46.968
You can go right up
to your seat.

00:02:46.968 --> 00:02:48.133
Thank you very much.

00:02:48.133 --> 00:02:49.734
-Thank you so much.

00:02:49.734 --> 00:02:52.067
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:52.067 --> 00:02:53.601
That's the best.

00:02:53.601 --> 00:02:55.701
[ Laughing ]

00:02:55.701 --> 00:02:57.734
Can we get a camera shot
of her going --

00:02:57.734 --> 00:03:01.400
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:03.467
Oh, my God.

00:03:03.467 --> 00:03:05.300
[ Laughs ]

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:06.534
And you don't even know
what's happening.

00:03:06.534 --> 00:03:09.734
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.734 --> 00:03:11.133
Oh, you look great.

